menu "esp_tinylm"

    config ESP_TINYLM_ENABLE_PIE
        bool "Use ESP32-S31 PIE vector kernel when available"
        default y
        help
            On ESP32-S31, run the int4 matvec on the PIE (xespv) vector unit for
            a large speedup. Has no effect on other targets, which always use the
            portable scalar path. Disable to force the scalar path everywhere
            (e.g. for A/B numerical comparison).

endmenu
